segments.text:
Hence we may gather a very fruitfull doctrine;
Doct.
namely, that as oft as God promiſeth his ſeruants victory againſt their enemies, they muſt not by and by gather this concluſion thence: We may therefore become careleſſe or idle; but the rather to gather in their ſpirits vnto them, that they may walke in their vocation and calling with inuincible conſtancy; neuer being weary of well doing. In a word, God promiſeth hee will deliuer him;
but therewithall he alſo exhorts him manfully to ſuſtaine all the aſſaults of his enemies.
